# Local dev secrets for Cna.OrleansHost's PostgreSQL + Marten journal (Phase A of issue #439,
# docs/work/plans/2026-11-18-postgres-migration-design.md §8: "locally we just use a env file
# like normal"). Copy this file to .env (already gitignored) and fill in real values; .env itself
# is never committed.
#
# Two separate connection strings, one per tier, per the design doc's §2/§2.1 database-per-tier
# shape -- never one shared database/schema with a tier-discriminator column. Tests don't read
# these directly: Cna.OrleansHost.Tests spins up its own disposable PostgreSQL via Testcontainers
# (tests/Cna.OrleansHost.Tests/Persistence/PostgresContainerFixture.cs). These are for running
# Cna.OrleansHost itself (src/Cna.AppHost / src/Cna.OrleansHost) against a real local Postgres.

SANDTABLE_POSTGRES_HOT_CONNECTION_STRING=Host=localhost;Port=5432;Database=sandtable_hot;Username=sandtable;Password=changeme
SANDTABLE_POSTGRES_COLD_CONNECTION_STRING=Host=localhost;Port=5432;Database=sandtable_cold;Username=sandtable;Password=changeme
